<title>JAPAN: Nissan Sept domestic output down 7.5%.</title>
<headline>Nissan Sept domestic output down 7.5%.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-10-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nissan Motor Co Ltd said on Friday that its domestic vehicle production, exports, domestic sales and overseas output in September were as follows:</p>
<p> Production	  146,423   down 7.5 percent</p>
<p>  - Cars	     129,661   down 7.5 percent</p>
<p>  - Trucks &amp; Buses  16,762   down 7.1 percent</p>
<p> Domestic sales    110,500   up  1.3 percent</p>
<p>  - Cars		81,732   up  0.2 percent</p>
<p>  - Trucks &amp; Buses  28,768   up  4.6 percent</p>
<p> Exports		54,992   up  3.0 percent</p>
<p>  - Cars		48,122   up  2.8 percent</p>
<p>  - Trucks &amp; Buses   6,870   up  4.0 percent</p>
<p> Overseas output    96,707   up  4.3 percent</p>
</text>
